# 强制仓库内文本文件统一行尾为 LF
# 解决 Windows 上 Git autocrlf=true 导致某些工具编辑后行尾变 CRLF
# 引入大量 diff 噪音的问题。Python/TS/JS/MD/JSON 全部 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.gz binary